+|---|---|---:|---|---|
+| easy | Gemini 3.8 Flash | 2083188677 | error | OpenRouter HTTP 403: key limit exceeded |
+| easy | Gemini 3.8 Flash | 1272812962 | error | OpenRouter HTTP 403: key limit exceeded |
